PROJECT UPDATE - REDEFINE SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE BEFORE CONTINUING DEVELOPMENT

IMPORTANT CONTEXT:

The current design direction is incorrect.

This is NOT a vendor-submitted promo claim portal.

Vendors do NOT proactively submit promotional credits owed to us.

Our actual workflow is:

TREES POS Sales Data
→ Promo Credit Discovery
→ Internal Credit Validation
→ Vendor Outreach
→ Vendor Response
→ Credit Memo / Deduction / Payment
→ Accounting Application
→ Reporting & Recovery Analytics

We identify credits owed to us and pursue vendors for reimbursement.

The existing Promo Credit Tracker already performs many core functions:

